{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50948","headline":"永丰桥闲坐 · 吕从庆","name":"永丰桥闲坐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"敝袜轻鞋缓足投，永丰桥上寄双眸。\n山沿东舍环西舍，水遶南畴赴北畴。\n村妇坐畦挑马齿，野童蹲涧采鷄头。\n娱闲不觉忘中饭，一点斜阳射竹楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕从庆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50948.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50948","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}